<title>BELGIUM: BERGINVEST H1 1996 NET SLIDES.</title>
<headline>BERGINVEST H1 1996 NET SLIDES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net				  54.5 vs    75.4</p>
<p>    Cons current			   107.0 vs   156.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			     1,228.0 vs 1,296.0</p>
<p>    Net cash flow			  148.6 vs   187.6</p>
<p>    Provision for fiscal dispute	10.0 vs    22.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Berginvest NV, a unit of speciality chemicals group Floridienne SA, said it would pay a net interim dividend of 60 francs.</p>
<p>NOTE - Berginvest said in a statement that the start of the second half of 1996 showed a favourable development in the U.S.</p>
<p>billiards market and increased demand in the glass fibre sector.</p>
<p>But it added it was premature to say with certainty that this development would continue in the second half.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
